Assertions:
[NAV] URL is {{FRONT_URL}}/company/sales-reps {OBSERVED}
[DOM] page heading reads "Sales reps" (i18n key sales_rep.page.title) {DOC}
[DOM] "Sales reps" link is visible in the account left rail under "Corporate" {DOC}
[DOM] table renders with "Name", "Email", "Phone" column headers {DOC}
[STATE] at least one row shows a rep serving ACME (e.g. @td(SR_REP_PRIMARY.fullName)) {OBSERVED}

[DOM] the row's "Name" cell shows @td(SR_REP_PRIMARY.fullName) {OBSERVED}
[DOM] the row's "Email" cell shows @td(SR_REP_PRIMARY.email) {OBSERVED}
[DOM] the row's "Phone" cell shows a non-empty phone value {DOC}

[DOM] table contains a row for @td(SR_REP_PRIMARY.fullName) {DOC}
[DOM] no row shows @td(SR_REP_BLOCKED.fullName) {DOC}
[DOM] no row shows @td(SR_REP_LOCKED.fullName) {DOC}

