[PRE:CLEAR_SESSION]
[PRE:SIGNIN_AS:ACME_BUYER]
@td(ORG_ACME.id) is served by >=2 distinctly-named reps (SR_REP_PRIMARY, SR_REP_ACME2).

[PRE:CLEAR_SESSION]
[PRE:SIGNIN_AS:ACME_BUYER]
@td(ORG_ACME.id) is served by >=2 distinctly-named reps.

Assertions:
[DOM] empty view shows text "No sales reps match your search" (sales_rep.table.no_results) {DOC}
[DOM] empty view shows a "Reset search" button (sales_rep.table.reset_search) {DOC}
[DOM] the generic "No sales reps found" (no-keyword) empty text is NOT shown instead {DOC}

[DOM] search input field's value is an empty string after clicking Reset search {DOC}
[COUNT] table row count returns to the pre-search unfiltered total {DOC}
[STATE] table is showing page 1 of results {DOC}

Preconditions:
[PRE:CLEAR_SESSION]
[PRE:SIGNIN_AS:ACME_BUYER]
@td(ORG_ACME.id) served by >=2 distinctly-named reps (SR_REP_PRIMARY, SR_REP_ACME2).

Assertions:
[DOM] row order is UNCHANGED after clicking "Email" header {DOC}
[DOM] row order is UNCHANGED after clicking "Phone" header {DOC}
[DOM] verify whether either header shows any sort affordance (cursor/icon) at all — expected: none {HYPOTHESIS}

[COUNT] page 1 shows exactly 10 rows {DOC}
[COUNT] page 2's row count equals (totalCount - 10), with zero rep names repeated from page 1 {DOC}
[DOM] pagination control's active-page indicator element shows "2" (selected state) {DOC}
[STATE] page change scrolls the viewport back to the top {DOC}

[DOM] page heading text is localized (not the raw i18n key "sales_rep.page.title") {DOC}
[DOM] "Name"/"Email"/"Phone" column headers are localized (not raw i18n keys) {DOC}
[DOM] search input's placeholder attribute text is localized (not the raw i18n key "sales_rep.table.search_placeholder") {DOC}

[NETWORK] a fresh customerSalesReps request fires again on the second mount {OBSERVED}
[MATH] second-mount request variables == first-mount request variables (byte-identical) {OBSERVED}
[DOM] rep rows visible on the second mount match that mount's own response {SPEC}
